  "metadataEvidence": "TIME_MODULE_METADATA.json",
  "criticalEvidence": [
    "Static3534 fields now/startTime/isInit/timeDifference/defaultTime/IsFocus; cctor27293 defaultTime DateTime(1970,1,1,8,0,0), difference0, focus true. Initialize27253 sets startTime=defaultTime. GetTime27270/GetNowTime27271 compute local DateTime subtraction TotalMilliseconds plus difference. GetNowTimeInt27272/Long27273 use seconds and ignore difference; exported overflow conversions return signed minimum.",
    "Source Initialize replaces complete/second/minute/millisecond/deadline dictionaries; resets lastTime16,lastMinute32,timeId40 but not lastMillisecond24 or unityRealTime48. ClearTimer27258 clears these same maps then resets selected fields; full method also clears loop/Unity maps outside this countdown component.",
    "AddCoundDown227275: null complete returns-1 before any mutation; unchecked ++id, completeHandles.Add, GetNowTime()+duration, completeTimes.Add, optional everyMillisecond.Add(id,new Every(callback,interval1)). Wrapper27283 delegates exactly. Remove27276 removes in order complete/deadline/second/minute/millisecond, then observes count of complete/second/minute. RemoveTime27284 delegates.",
    "Check27277 captures GetTime date once then runs complete -> second -> millisecond -> minute. CheckTime27282 writes float realtime as double before checking. Source Update27255 supplies DateTime.Now and Unity realtime, then also invokes loop and Unity timer branches not yet implemented here.",
    "CheckComplete27278 snapshots parallel key/callback lists from dictionary enumeration, creates shared instance removeList88. Iterates captured callbacks but consults live deadlines; at deadline<=now invokes first, then adds id to current instance removeList. Cleanup only after entire callback loop; thrown callback skips remaining calls and cleanup, so previously completed callbacks may replay. Callback removes later deadline => skip; replacement of callback does not replace snapshot. Added entries absent from current complete snapshot.",
    "CheckSecond27279 threshold now-last>=1000, Millisecond27280 now>last; both update last after successful pass even if their maps empty. Minute27281 requires now-last>=60000 AND nonempty map before writing last. Every passes snapshot objects even if removed from live map; missing deadline yields remaining0. Last timestamp is reread per callback; earlier callback/reentry can change elapsed for later entries.",
    "Remaining is WASM int conversion of deadline-now BEFORE /1000 or /60000 integer division; oversized/NaN values map int.MinValue. Elapsed double delta demoted float before unit division. Every3537.Call27310 adds float elapsed, once if interval<=accum invokes callback then resets0; no catch-up loop or remainder retention. Throw leaves accumulator and outer last timestamp unchanged.",
    "Countdown methods have no focus/pause gate. GameFocus27257 only writes static focus; GamePause27256 touches loop timer dictionary76 when event bool true. Complete module event subscription and loop-specific pause behavior are not implemented by this countdown component."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "OutgameTimeCountdowns is the source countdown projection, not a replacement for the full TimeModule startup module. LoopTimers, Unity timers, event subscriptions and complete module lifecycle still pending.",
    "Native validation uses real source DateTime countdown and actual AudioSource; fixture remains for full resource and shared update ownership. No device recording, full Main entry or Player build claim."
  ]
